  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* NOT-364 extend the Notification cache on mutation to avoid racing the server by @mattmapadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/276\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3807 Update URLs on the test app for privacy notice by @RaphealOlumofe in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/275\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3852 fix button contrast by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/277\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3854 Change engine size content to match DVLA by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/278\r\n* Remove \"profile\" feature flag override for prod builds by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/279\r\n* Update version 1.4.0 -> 1.5 for release by @kris-skierniewski in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/280\r\n* Fix double-tap continue option 2 by @batesyuk in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/282\r\n* GOVUKAPP-3890 - Updated verify token passing by @batesyuk in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/298\r\n* NOT-449 remove coupling of Messages to DVLA linking, (cherry-pick) by @mattmapadmi in https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/pull/299\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/govuk-once/govuk-mobile-ios-app/compare/1.4...1.5",
